y them  Sylvester is attempting to unravel this  mystery meanwhile in the year  2540 you have the crew of this huge  spaceship called The Nostalgia for  Infinity their Captain is infected with  some insane virus called the melding  plague which attacks machinery and  biology lots of humans in the series are  basically cyborgs and this disease melds  the biological components to the  mechanical components and creates just  like horrifying cancerous gross  basically it's really interesting they  have their Captain basically hibernating  but sometimes they can activate him and  he has to speak through the computer  components because his body just can't  do it anymore he's like so far gone that  the only way they can keep him alive is  to keep him basically is to keep him  basically Frozen most of the time so  these guys are headed to the planet  Yellowstone to Chasm city which is like  one of the most advanced cities  in the galaxy and because they use  nanotechnology the buildings can  literally rearrange themselves and  rebuild themselves and like add floors  and stuff like that the crew of The  Nostalgia for Infinity is headed there  because they think that sevestive will  be there but he won't be he'll be on  resurgum and then we have in the  earliest timeline 2524 also on Chasm  City we have anakuri who is an assassin  hired by a mysterious figure known as  the Mademoiselle who definitely comes up  later in the books anyway huori is hired  to assassinate sylveste long story short  anacori infiltrates the crew of  nostalgia for Infinity eventually and  they head forward circum to find selves  so long story short all of this comes  together and makes sense in the end we  do find out what happened to the  amarantins we do find out who the  Mademoiselle is and why she wants so  that's the dead and how that even ties  in to the mysterious massive zones in  space called the shrouds that some refer  to as Revelation space  so now we'll get into the major Major  Spoilers so if you really don't want to  know anything you should really click  off now so as I said in the beginning of  Revelation space Sylvester is digging up  some pretty well preserved remains of  the alien race known as the amarantins  and these remains are about a million  years old this alien race at one point  had split into two different groups one  group The banished became space fairing  they left the main society but in doing  so they awakened something devastatingly  powerful  this was the power that wiped out the  amarantine race  the banished ones were able to hide  themselves in these zones in outer space  which humans eventually referred to as  the Shroud now eon's past an eventually  different factions emerged within the  Shroud one of these groups wanted to  test whether or not this Force which had  destroyed the main society was still  around another faction in the Shroud  also develops they believe that this is  a bad idea because this could  potentially alert this force that they  are in fact hiding within the Shroud  still so each of these factions creates  a program one manifests itself as the  entity known as Sun Steeler one  manifests itself as the entity known as  The Madame wazow now the beings known as  the Inhibitors which had destroyed the  main amarantin society left triggers  presumably all over that would alert  them if another race became space  fairing Sun Steeler hoped to test  whether or not they still existed by  luring another race into triggering that  Beacon and that's exactly what happens  sylvesty unwittingly activates the  inhibitor Beacon and this of course  leads to a devastating war between the  Inhibitors and Humanity the Inhibitors  were an impossibly old race of beings  left over from an ancient war known as  the dawn War once we got into space  once we left the first system we began  to find dead cultures all over the place  none had survived until much more  recently than a million years ago and  some had gone out a lot earlier than  that  but they all point it to one thing  the Galaxy had been a lot more thickened  in the past  so why not now  why was it suddenly so lonely  the war Corey said and for a moment no  one spoke the silence was only  interrupted when valiova begins speaking  softly and reverently as if they were  discussing something sacred  yes she said the dawn war that was what  they called it wasn't it  and it sucked up all those cultures and  spat them out in shapes and forms a lot  different to the ones they'd had when  they went in I don't think we can really  understand what it was about or who or  what exactly survived it except that  they were more like machines than living  creatures  although as far beyond anything we can  envisage as our machines are Beyond  stone tools but they had a name  or they were given it  I don't really remember the details but  I do remember the name  the Inhibitors vargova said Corey nodded  so if you're a fan of some of the books  that I cover on this channel then you  might be thinking this is kind of  similar to the three body problem the  Dark Forest hypothesis may be or what  happens in The Killing star but you be  wrong because this is significantly  different  and now for the even bigger spoilers for  this series it turns out that the  Inhibitors were actually created by the  survivors of the Dawn War they were  non-sentient beings they referred to  themselves as post-intelligent their job  wasn't simply to wipe out threatening  space-faring civilizations their job was  to Shepherd the Galaxy  through an upcoming crisis and that  crisis was the collision between the  Milky Way galaxy and the Andromeda  galaxy which would take place in about 3  billion years by keeping all  civilizations on single planets or solar  systems it made the process of moving  star systems and planets to avoid  collisions during this time far simpler  and thus it avoided the most amount of  death  however if there was no way for the  Inhibitors to